# Falsification-Carrying Development

Concept-ID: `SOUNIO-FALSIFICATION-CARRYING-DEVELOPMENT`

Status: executable for the bounded nominal kernel. The coordination runtime
verifies the Git-bound experimental chain. The first language slice adds
nominal states that prevent an observed, falsified, or inconclusive result from
substituting for a supported result in Sounio code. Imported checking is green;
imported native execution remains blocked by the existing thin-link `rc=12`, so
runtime evidence uses exact single-module composition of the same source.

